      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不！\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>麻痺<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>才是第一！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0DFF01000A00100002FF0000069EBB75FA00100002FF000000624D662F7B2C4E00FF01001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "陷入麻痺的寶可夢\n移動速度會變慢！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "967751659EBB75FA76845BF653EF5922000A79FB52D5901F5EA667038B8A6162FF01001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "趁著對手慢吞吞時一鼓作氣進攻，\n就能優雅地獲勝！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D8184575C0D624B6162541E541E66424E009F134F5C6C239032653BFF0C000A5C3180FD512A96C55730737252DDFF01001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這位路過的人！\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳來得正好！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90194F4D8DEF904E76844EBAFF01000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B34F865F976B63597DFF01001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是中毒還是麻痺！\n讓我們測試一下哪種比較厲害吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F4E2D6BD29084662F9EBB75FAFF01000A8B93621150116E2C8A664E004E0B54EA7A2E6BD48F0353B25BB354273002001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "換句話說，就是寶可夢對戰！\n由我先上場囉！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "63DB53E58A718AAAFF0C5C31662F5BF653EF59225C0D6230FF01000A7531621151484E0A583456C9FF01001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是中毒還是麻痺！\n讓我們測試看看哪一種更厲害吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F4E2D6BD29084662F9EBB75FAFF01000A8B93621150116E2C8A66770B770B54EA4E007A2E66F453B25BB35427FF1F001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "首先是我的麻痺戰術！\n來，我們開始！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
