      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "開始吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "958B59CB5427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "還是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9084662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "您是一聽見麻痺戰術，\n就心生畏懼了嗎！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60A8662F4E00807D898B9EBB75FA62308853FF0C000A5C315FC3751F754F61FC4E8655CEFF01001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "陷入麻痺的寶可夢\n移動速度會變慢！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "967751659EBB75FA76845BF653EF5922000A79FB52D5901F5EA667038B8A6162FF01001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我會趁著您無法如願行動時，\n一鼓作氣進攻，結束對戰！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621167038D81845760A871216CD559829858884C52D56642FF0C000A4E009F134F5C6C239032653BFF0C7D50675F5C0D6230FF01001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "中毒戰術才是最強的，\n但寶可夢對戰的順序我就讓妳當第一吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E2D6BD262308853624D662F67005F377684FF0C000A4F465BF653EF59225C0D6230768498065E8F62115C318B9359B375767B2C4E0054273002001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我徹底被打敗了……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1292,
