      "offsetInSection": 1564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00190000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "接下來就看我的毒！\n準備好要寶可夢對戰了嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
