      "offsetInSection": 1828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果寶可夢陷入了麻痺狀態，\n請用解麻藥幫牠治療！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
