      "offsetInSection": 2272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60A889BA5F9775705E3872C0614B000A6839672C662F5C0F83DC4E00789F55CEFF01FF1F001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不過，我和古杜莉您\n都同樣沒能打贏<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā他她呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
